OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over fatal hit-and-run
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged in connection
OL,7,Fwith a fatal hit-and-run collision in
OL,8,FCounty Antrim.
OL,10,FA man in his 50s was killed and a woman
OL,11,Fin her 40s was seriously injured, after
OL,12,Fthey were knocked down on the
OL,13,FBallyeaston Road, Ballyclare on 15
OL,14,FAugust 2025.
OL,16,FA 57-year-old man has been charged with
OL,17,Fa number of offences relating to the
OL,18,Fcollision, including causing death by
OL,19,Fdangerous driving and causing death by
OL,20,Fdriving carelessly with excess alcohol.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
